// PowerShell Running Under Another File Name
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_renamed_powershell.yml (530c023a-4dbf-4c64-a079-7bd4e74b2767)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1036.003 Rename Legitimate Utilities
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and ((process.pe.original_file_name like~ ("PowerShell.EXE", "pwsh.dll")) and (not (process.executable like~ ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\powershell_ise.exe"))))
